---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Contact — TempMail" description="Where to send questions about the TempMail website and its mailbox provider.">
  <article class="page-wrap prose-page">
    <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Contact</span></nav>
    <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
    <h1>Need to get in touch?</h1>
    <p class="page-lede">TempMail is a small interface to a third-party mailbox provider. For address, delivery, or message-retention questions, contact Guerrilla Mail directly.</p>
    <p><a class="button button-outline" href="mailto:support@guerrillamail.com">Email Guerrilla Mail support</a></p>
    <p>The provider lists this address in its <a href="https://www.guerrillamail.com/GuerrillaMailAPI.html" rel="noopener noreferrer">API documentation</a>. This site does not currently publish a separate monitored support inbox.</p>
    <p>For data handling details, read the <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
